# Shelly 1

Single-relay Shelly 1 firmware for the IotCloud platform.

Pin mapping:

- GPIO4: relay output
- GPIO5: Shelly SW input, used as an external sticky switch
- GPIO0: status LED and IotCloud setup/reset pin

The Shelly SW terminal is a mains-capable input. Follow the Shelly wiring and
electrical-safety requirements when connecting an external switch.
